# 📚 TOEIC Vocabulary - Day27

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| postpone | 연기하다 | The meeting was postponed until Friday. |
| extend | 연장하다 | The company extended the deadline. |
| notify | 알리다 | Please notify us of any changes. |
| request | 요청하다 | The customer requested a refund. |
| arrange | 준비하다, 마련하다 | We arranged a meeting with the client. |

